# A pig farm raises a pig on the grain the castle sends it: the pig farmer stands inside from the start, two grains lie on the castle's flag, a
# carrier takes them over the road to the pig farm's flag and on into the pig farm, the pig farmer takes a grain out and works in
# stretches, and a pig grows and goes out to the flag and back to the castle. The script fast-forwards to the pig on the step out, takes a shot,
# then to the castle's first pig and takes a shot of the pig farm and its road. Run it on the layout, under either graphics source:
#   sh tools/play-run.sh pig-farm --layout layouts/pig-farm.jsonc --fps 10
#   sh tools/play-run.sh pig-farm --layout layouts/pig-farm.jsonc --fps 10 --graphics open-settlers
wait 0.3
expect pigs = 0
expect-at 13 10 pig-farm
fast-forward pig-farmer carrying max 60000
scroll up 6 860 560
wait 0.3
shot pig-out
fast-forward until pigs >= 1 max 60000
wait 0.3
dump pig-stored
shot pig-stored
expect pigs >= 1
